<ResearchLayout title="P4｜Technology｜J 的世界 Research" page="P4" section="TECHNOLOGY">

<div class="kicker">P4 · TECHNOLOGY</div><h1>從晶片走向系統</h1>
<p class="lead">研究的重點，不是預測單一技術何時取代另一項技術，而是觀察每一個節點何時從「技術可能性」進入「驗證、導入與量產」。</p>
<div class="visual visual-diagram"><div class="diagram-title">AI Platform Technology Path</div><div class="diagram-row">
<div class="node">AI Compute<small>運算需求</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">Advanced Process<small>製程</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">Advanced Packaging<small>封裝</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">Optical Interconnect<small>光互連</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">Thermal / Power<small>散熱／電力</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">System<small>系統</small></div>
</div></div>
<div class="note"><strong>簡單說</strong>一顆更快的晶片只是起點。當運算密度提高，封裝、互連、散熱與電力會一起被拉進來。</div>
<div class="section"><div class="section-title"><span>EVIDENCE CHECKPOINTS</span><h2>研究真正要等的是這四步</h2></div>
<div class="flow"><div class="flow-item"><small>01</small><strong>驗證</strong><span>技術是否進入客戶驗證？</span></div><div class="flow-item"><small>02</small><strong>導入</strong><span>是否進入實際製程或產品？</span></div><div class="flow-item"><small>03</small><strong>量產</strong><span>是否形成產能與營收？</span></div><div class="flow-item"><small>04</small><strong>擴散</strong><span>是否擴展到更多平台？</span></div></div></div>

</ResearchLayout>
